<title>AUSTRALIA: Foodland half year net profit A$28.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Foodland half year net profit A$28.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Jan 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  28.7 vs 21.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		  17.0 vs 14.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Foodland Associated Ltd is a food retailer and wholesaler.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit			 45.1 vs 32.1</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			  1.85 vs 1.87</p>
<p>    Other income			   170.20 vs 143.90</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     27.95 vs 21.41</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			    nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
